1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,680
Ten places humans could live.

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:03,340
Some already exist.

3
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:05,202
The best, we didn't build.

4
00:00:05,852 --> 00:00:08,604
In Coober Pedy, about half the town lives underground.

5
00:00:08,854 --> 00:00:11,736
In Milan, two towers wear eight hundred trees.

6
00:00:11,986 --> 00:00:14,532
Off Florida, scientists live on the seafloor.

7
00:00:14,782 --> 00:00:17,048
A floating neighborhood is designed for Busan.

8
00:00:17,298 --> 00:00:19,448
A private space station is being assembled.

9
00:00:19,698 --> 00:00:22,395
NASA designed a spinning ring for ten thousand people.

10
00:00:22,645 --> 00:00:23,555
High above Venus:

11
00:00:24,015 --> 00:00:26,662
Earth-like pressure, inside acid clouds.

12
00:00:26,912 --> 00:00:29,552
On Titan: no pressure suit, but no oxygen.

13
00:00:30,032 --> 00:00:31,849
Minus 179 degrees.

14
00:00:32,099 --> 00:00:34,235
Mars has pits that may open into caves.

15
00:00:34,485 --> 00:00:35,225
And on the Moon,

16
00:00:35,495 --> 00:00:38,199
radar revealed evidence of a possible underground cave.

17
00:00:39,049 --> 00:00:41,219
Our first home beyond Earth may not be built.

18
00:00:41,739 --> 00:00:42,559
It may be found.

19
00:00:43,009 --> 00:00:43,837
Where would you live?
